      "content": "i don't see the point in any of that. eating, sleeping... what's the point of just maintaining a body that's basically a shell of a person now? it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's just a slow way to suffer. i just want the noise to stop. i want to feel like i actually have a say in when this ends.",
